    "id": "sub10.example.org",
    "context_attributes": { "type": "subdomain" }
  }
]
```

If you want to retrieve the actual data, you can use the following cURL command (replace `my_api` with your real API key):

```bash
curl -H "x-apikey: my_api" \
     "https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/related?limit=10&continuation_cursor=abc"
```

This will return a JSON payload similar to the one above, but populated with the real related subdomains.
